        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAJOR UPDATE SCHEDULED – JUNE 7th 2026 (OUT NOW!!!)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive update is coming to <i>Glowbot Galaxy</i> featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full visual overhaul (shown in current screenshots and trailers)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-player local multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced UI and level select screens</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved loading screens</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug fixes and stability improvements (no more crashes!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW Color Selector – customize your Glowbot to any color you want</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved demo build (now includes the first full galaxy)</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Glowbot Galaxy</i>, you’ll step into a glowing universe where the fate of the Glowbots rests in your hands. When the Demon King steals their Queen and scatters their stars across distant galaxies, the Glowbots’ only hope is a daring voyage across seven vibrant worlds to reclaim the power that fuels their ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through galaxies that burst with color and personality:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starfall Fields</strong> – shimmering skybridges among the stars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cascade Tides</strong> – radiant beaches and drifting currents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basalt Barrens</strong> – a crumbling realm of volcanic stone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blightbloom Grove</strong> – glowing with spores and strange life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FrostBite Nebula</strong> – frozen platforms drifting in the void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lavatide Cliffs</strong> – pulsing with molten danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Abyss</strong> – a haunting world of shadows and starlight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world is packed with hidden paths, glowing challenges, and secret stars waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>35 handcrafted levels</strong> and <strong>7 unique boss battles</strong>, your journey is full of surprises, platforming challenges, and cosmic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, colorful, and glowing with atmosphere, <i>Glowbot Galaxy</i> invites you to explore, discover, and fight for the light of your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you reclaim the stolen stars, save your Queen, and restore hope to the galaxy?</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAJOR UPDATE SCHEDULED – JUNE 7th 2026 (OUT NOW!!!)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive update is coming to <i>Glowbot Galaxy</i> featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full visual overhaul (shown in current screenshots and trailers)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-player local multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced UI and level select screens</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved loading screens</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug fixes and stability improvements (no more crashes!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW Color Selector – customize your Glowbot to any color you want</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved demo build (now includes the first full galaxy)</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Glowbot Galaxy</i>, you’ll step into a glowing universe where the fate of the Glowbots rests in your hands. When the Demon King steals their Queen and scatters their stars across distant galaxies, the Glowbots’ only hope is a daring voyage across seven vibrant worlds to reclaim the power that fuels their ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through galaxies that burst with color and personality:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starfall Fields</strong> – shimmering skybridges among the stars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cascade Tides</strong> – radiant beaches and drifting currents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basalt Barrens</strong> – a crumbling realm of volcanic stone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blightbloom Grove</strong> – glowing with spores and strange life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FrostBite Nebula</strong> – frozen platforms drifting in the void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lavatide Cliffs</strong> – pulsing with molten danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Abyss</strong> – a haunting world of shadows and starlight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world is packed with hidden paths, glowing challenges, and secret stars waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>35 handcrafted levels</strong> and <strong>7 unique boss battles</strong>, your journey is full of surprises, platforming challenges, and cosmic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, colorful, and glowing with atmosphere, <i>Glowbot Galaxy</i> invites you to explore, discover, and fight for the light of your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you reclaim the stolen stars, save your Queen, and restore hope to the galaxy?</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Glowbot Galaxy is a charming cosmic adventure where glowing Glowbots travel across 7 vibrant galaxies to reclaim their stolen stars and rescue their queen from the Demon King. Explore 35 handcrafted levels and challenge 7 epic bosses in colorful, glowing worlds filled with secrets and surprises.",
